==============================================================================================================================
L32 -- necessary conditions on ANY theory giving a0 = kappa c sqrt(G rho_Lambda) with a fixed coefficient
==============================================================================================================================
    Planck footing for the cosmology: H0 = 67.4 km/s/Mpc, Omega_Lambda = 0.685
    rho_Lambda = 5.8452e-27 kg/m^3;  Lambda = 1.0908e-52 m^-2;  L_dS = sqrt(3/Lambda) = 1.6584e+26 m = 5374 Mpc

