    A3: Lambda's direct acceleration Lambda c^2 r/3 at 10 kpc = 1.008e-15 m/s^2 = 1.08e-05 a0 (canonical), 8.94e-06 a0 (alt)
    A3: it reaches a0 only at r = 3 a0/(Lambda c^2) = 928 Mpc -- outside any bound system
  [FAIL] A3 [structure] Lambda's direct dynamical effect at galactic radii is at least 1% of a0, so the two sectors could communicate through a term in the equations of motion   (it is 1.1e-05 a0, five orders down => the tie CANNOT be a dynamical effect of Lambda on galaxies. It must be a relation between CONSTANTS, i.e. between the vacuum structures of the two sectors at zeroth order in the fields. NECESSARY CONDITION N1 established by this failure.)
    A4: enumerate mechanisms by (m, n): rho_vac ~ Z~ X^m, a0 ~ beta sqrt(G) X^n.  kappa^2 = a0^2/(G rho_vac c^2) ~ X^(2n-m):
        amplitude-independent (2n = m) pairs with m, n <= 6: [(2, 1), (4, 2), (6, 3)]  -> the vacuum energy must be the SQUARE (or the 2k-th power) of the same order parameter that a0 is LINEAR (k-th power) in
        de Sitter values of the local curvature scalars: R = 4 Lambda, R_mn R^mn = 4 Lambda^2, R_mnrs R^mnrs = 8 Lambda^2/3, box R = 0, R^2 = 16 Lambda^2, C_mnrs C^mnrs = 0, R^3 = 64 Lambda^3
        every one is an INTEGER power of Lambda, i.e. an EVEN power of a mass scale; a0 needs an ODD power (mass dimension 1)
        the 'just add a mass scale M' evasion, enumerated: a0 = Lambda^k / M^(2k-1) for integer k >= 1 and any INDEPENDENT M gives
        d ln a0 / d ln Lambda = 1, 2, 3, 4 -- never the required 1/2, for any k and any M.
  [FAIL] A4 [theorem] some polynomial scalar built from the curvature takes a half-integer power of Lambda on de Sitter, so a local curvature invariant (or an anomaly-induced term built from them) could supply a0   (none does: all are Lambda^n with n integer, and pairing an integer power with an independent mass scale gives d ln a0/d ln Lambda = k, never 1/2.  a0 ~ Lambda^(1/2) therefore requires an ORDER PARAMETER of odd mass dimension whose square is the vacuum energy -- (m, n) = (2, 1).  This excludes the anomaly and every curvature-polynomial route, and it is exactly why the four-form (eps ~ q^2, a0 ~ q) is the structure that works.  NECESSARY CONDITION N2.)
    A5: X = (rho_Lambda c^2)^(1/4) = 2.240 meV;  a0_seesaw = X^2/M_Pl = 4.1113e-34 eV = 1.8726e-10 m/s^2
